  "contentHtml": "\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">honey butter skillet corn is the effortless, can’t-stop-eating side that elevates sweet corn with rich butter and a kiss of honey. In a hot skillet, the kernels caramelize slightly, landing that savory-sweet balance we all crave. A splash of citrus, fresh thyme, and a pinch of chili flakes bring brightness and gentle heat, so every bite pops with flavor. Ready in minutes and fit for any table—from summer cookouts to holiday spreads and cozy weeknights—honey butter skillet corn is a guaranteed crowd-pleaser.<br></p>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-rank-math-toc-block\" id=\"rank-math-toc\"><h2>Table of Contents</h2><nav><ul><li><a href=\"#why-youll-love-this-honey-butter-skillet-corn\">Why You’ll Love This Honey Butter Skillet Corn</a></li><li><a href=\"#ingredients\">Ingredients</a></li><li><a href=\"#how-to-make-honey-butter-skillet-corn\">How to Make Honey Butter Skillet Corn</a></li><li><a href=\"#recipe-snapshot\">Recipe Snapshot</a></li><li><a href=\"#pro-tips-for-making-honey-butter-skillet-corn\">Pro Tips for Making Honey Butter Skillet Corn</a></li><li><a href=\"#how-to-serve-this-honey-butter-skillet-corn\">How to Serve this Honey Butter Skillet Corn</a></li><li><a href=\"#make-ahead-and-storage\">Make Ahead and Storage</a></li><li><a href=\"#fa-qs\">FAQs</a></li><li><a href=\"#final-thoughts\">Final Thoughts</a></li></ul></nav></div>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"why-youll-love-this-honey-butter-skillet-corn\"><strong>Why You’ll Love This Honey Butter Skillet Corn</strong></h2>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>It&#8217;s a sweet and savory delight that elevates any meal.</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Quick and easy to make, perfect for busy weeknights.</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Brings a burst of flavor that kids and adults will adore.</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Versatile side dish that pairs well with any protein.</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Uses simple ingredients you likely have on hand.</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n<div id=\"wprm-recipe-conta